ages the planet Earth and no weapon is effective against the space ships, as they have the technology to control human combat vehicles. Oliver, an aeronautical engineer, manages to adapt a ship so that it is not controlled by the aliens and is humanity's only hope. He seeks to rescue his girlfriend Marjorie, who is a pilot and was abducted in combat. Will you be able to help Oliver rescue his girl and save the planet?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>featuring:</u></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> levels with different colors representing different times of the day.<br></li><li> Intense shooting battles using 2D physics (shock waves caused by explosions).<br></li><li> Colorful and well-made graphics<br></li><li> Epic old Rock soundtracks.<br></li><li> Evolve your ship into 6 different atributes:</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>            \t<strong>Health Points</strong> -This Affects the size of the jet life bar<br></li><li>            \t<strong>Missile Fuel</strong> -This affects the missile duration time after launching<br></li><li>            \t<strong>Missile Perfomance</strong> – This affects missile speed and missile curvature<br></li><li>                    <strong>Missile Cooldown</strong> – This affects the recharge time of each missile<br></li><li>   \t                <strong>Machine Gun</strong> – This affects fire rate, shot impulse and amount of bullets<br></li><li>     \t        <strong>Jet Fuel</strong> – This affects the capacity of the jet gasoline tank.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >make Your Way to victory</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1415630/extras/2ffb8e0f164f8cca4fe3289c557349d6.poster.avif?t=1603975182\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1415630/extras/2ffb8e0f164f8cc